ry stays SILENT when a phase-development WI is selected and its phase's anchors are all `done` with no Draft SR — the primary \"lower gates already cleared, do not nag\" path is untested, so a future regression that over-warns on a cleared phase would pass -> add a fixture with a selected WI whose SR names a phase whose `[phase]-[g*]` anchors are all done and no Draft SRs, asserting `gate_first_findings(...) == []` -> @owner\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE findings=1","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
